#: src/libvlc-module.c:1027
msgid ""
"These options allow you to control the preferred modules used for accessing, "
"demuxing and decoding (or encoding) inputs."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann na roghanna seo duit na modúil is fearr leat a roghnú chun ionchuir "
"a rochtain, a dhí-ilphléacsáil agus a dhíchódú (nó a ionchódú)."

