msgid "Preferred decoders list"
msgstr "Liosta na ndíchódóirí is fearr leat"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1032
msgid ""
"List of codecs that VLC will use in priority. For instance, 'dummy,a52' will "
"try the dummy and a52 codecs before trying the other ones. Only advanced "
"users should alter this option as it can break playback of all your streams."
msgstr ""
"Liosta de na codecanna a úsáidfidh VLC ar dtús. Mar shampla, triailfidh "
"'dummy,a52' na codecanna dummy agus a52 sula dtriailfear na cinn eile. Níor "
"cheart ach d'ardúsáideoirí an rogha seo a athrú, mar is féidir léi athsheinm "
"do shruthanna go léir a bhriseadh."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1037
msgid "Enable hardware decoders"
msgstr "Cumasaigh díchódóirí crua-earraí"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1039
msgid ""
"VLC will fallback automatically to software decoders in case of hardware "
"decoder failure."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidfidh VLC díchódóirí bogearraí go huathoibríoch má theipeann ar an "
"díchódóir crua-earraí."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1042
msgid "Preferred decoder hardware device"
msgstr "An gléas crua-earraí díchódaithe is fearr leat"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1043
