msgid "Opaqueness"
msgstr "Teimhneacht"

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:55
msgid ""
"Set the transparency of the video output. 1 is non-transparent (default) 0 "
"is fully transparent."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh trédhearcacht an aschuir físeáin. Tá a 1 neamhthrédhearcach (an "
"réamhshocrú), 0 ná iomlán trédhearcach."

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:58
msgid "Black screens in fullscreen"
msgstr "Scáileáin dhubha i lánscáileán"

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:59
msgid "In fullscreen mode, keep screen where there is no video displayed black"
msgstr "Sa lánscáileán, coimeád an scáileán dubh nuair nach taispeántar físeán"

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:62
msgid "Auto-playback of new items"
msgstr "Athsheinm uathoibríoch míreanna nua"

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:63
msgid "Start playback of new items immediately once they were added."
msgstr ""
"Tosaigh athsheinm míreanna nua láithreach bonn nuair a chuirtear leis iad"

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:66
msgid "Keep Recent Items"
msgstr "Coimeád na nithe le déanaí"

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:67
msgid ""
"By default, VLC keeps a list of the last 10 items. This feature can be "
"disabled here."
msgstr ""
"Mar réamhshocrú, coimeádann VLC taifead de na 10 míreanna is déanaí. Is "
"féidir an ghné seo a díchumasú anseo."

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:70
msgid "Control playback with the Apple Remote"
msgstr "Rialaigh an athsheinm le Apple Remote"

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:71
msgid "By default, VLC can be remotely controlled with the Apple Remote."
msgstr "Mar réamhshocrú, is féidir VLC a chianrialú le Apple Remote."

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:73
msgid "Control system volume with the Apple Remote"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:74
msgid ""
"By default, VLC will control its own volume with the Apple Remote. However, "
"you can choose to control the global system volume instead."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:76
#: modules/gui/macosx/preferences/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:416
msgid "Display VLC status menu icon"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:77
msgid ""
"By default, VLC will show the statusbar icon menu. However, you can choose "
"to disable it (restart required)."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:79
msgid "Control play queue items with the Apple Remote"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:80
msgid ""
"By default, VLC will allow you to switch to the next or previous item with "
"the Apple Remote. You can disable this behavior with this option."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:82
#: modules/gui/macosx/preferences/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:386
msgid "Control playback with media keys"
msgstr "Rialaigh athsheinm le cnaipí meán"

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:83
msgid ""
"By default, VLC can be controlled using the media keys on modern Apple "
"keyboards."
msgstr ""
"Mar réamhshocrú, is féidir VLC a rialú trí fheidhm a bhaint as na cnaipí "
"meán ar mhéarchláir nua-aimseartha Apple."

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:86
#: modules/gui/macosx/preferences/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:460
msgid "Use the native fullscreen mode"
msgstr ""

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:87
msgid ""
"By default, VLC uses the fullscreen mode known from previous Mac OS X "
"releases. It can also use the native fullscreen mode on Mac OS X 10.7 and "
"later."
msgstr ""

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:89
#: modules/gui/macosx/preferences/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:453
#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:188
msgid "Resize interface to the native video size"
msgstr "Leasaigh toirt an chomhéadain go dtí méid dhúchasach an fhíseáin"

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:90 modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:189
msgid ""
"You have two choices:\n"
" - The interface will resize to the native video size\n"
" - The video will fit to the interface size\n"
" By default, interface resize to the native video size."
msgstr ""
"Tá dhá rogha agat:\n"
" - Athrófar méid an chomhéadain go dtí méid dúchasach an fhíseáin\n"
" - Oirfear an físeán do mhéid an chomhéadain\n"
" De réir réamhshocraithe, athraítear méid an chomhéadain go dtí méid "
"dúchasach an fhíseáin."

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:95
#: modules/gui/macosx/preferences/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:452
#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:278
