msgstr "Cuir athsheinm an fhíseáin ar sos nuair a íoslaghdaítear é"

#: modules/gui/macosx/main/macosx.m:96 modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:280
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, the playback will be automatically paused when "
