msgstr "Tosaíocht an phróisis"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:269
msgid ""
"How much processor time the system gives VLC compared with the other "
"programs."
msgstr ""
"An méid ama próiseálaí a thugann an córas do VLC i gcomparáid leis na "
"ríomhchláir eile."

